Package: migval
Title: One-Time Migration Validation Harness
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Simon", "Knuesel", email = "simon.knuesel@gmx.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Certifies that a new R transformation reproduces an old WYSIWYG
    transformation, one dataset at a time. The guarantee is a deterministic
    full-data multiset comparison computed locally, with no external calls and
    nothing uploaded. Built for a report you read, not a suite you keep.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    digest,
    dplyr,
    httr2,
    rlang,
    tibble,
    tidyr
Suggests:
    arrow
RoxygenNote: hand-written NAMESPACE; roxygen2 is not a dependency of this harness
